<title>GERMANY: ATHLETICS-BAUMANN MAY MISS BIG CROSS-COUNTRY RACE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BAUMANN MAY MISS BIG CROSS-COUNTRY RACE.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's former Olympic 5,000 metres champion Dieter Baumann may miss this weekend's European cross-country championship in Belgium because of sciatica.</p>
<p>&quot;We are not going to take any risks. If Dieter cannot run without pain, he won't compete,&quot; the German's coach and wife Isabelle Baumann said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
